  ('34ca5fcd-6211-49ca-9fbb-1d3c614ad25a', 'fd0b2b54-7239-4012-acff-fec10dff456d', '2026-09-13'::date, E'easy one. what did you notice today that you usually overlook... let me think.\n\ni said yes to something i wanted to say no to. again. something about rain makes everything feel allowed. my hands smell like garlic and i\'m happy. got some good news today that i\'m not ready to share yet. work has been a lot lately and i don\'t think i\'ve admitted that to anyone. i miss my grandpa. he\'d have had something funny to say about all this.\n\nmade soup. felt like a real adult for about forty minutes. i signed up for a pottery class!! terrified!! i think the answer is just: sleep more. it\'s always sleep more.\n\n💛', 'community', '2026-09-14T04:18:00+00:00'::timestamptz, '2026-09-14T04:18:14+00:00'::timestamptz),
