  ('5f7a1078-3fab-4637-a736-5400f853585b', '792b4681-f07f-4ef0-8826-6cc5821f0cf7', '2026-05-07'::date, E'Not sure where to start.\n\nRent went up. Trying not to spiral. I miss my grandpa. He\'d have had something funny to say about all this.\n\nI finally finished that book. The ending wrecked me. My hands smell like garlic and I\'m happy. Ran into an old friend at the grocery store. We said we\'d get coffee. We won\'t. I don\'t really know what I want right now and that scares me less than it used to. I think I\'ve been lonely and calling it independence. I keep replaying a dumb thing I said in a meeting. Nobody else remembers it, I\'m sure. I read on the train instead of scrolling and felt like a different person. I said yes to something I wanted to say no to. Again. The dog woke me up at 5 and honestly the sunrise was worth it. Got some good news today that I\'m not ready to share yet. Work has been a lot lately and I don\'t think I\'ve admitted that to anyone.\n\nI want to stop apologizing for taking up space.\n\nThere\'s this feeling where the afternoon stretches and nothing needs to happen. I want more of that.\n\nok bye', 'private', '2026-05-08T04:15:00+00:00'::timestamptz, '2026-05-08T04:15:27+00:00'::timestamptz),
