  ('5c1a09a8-cd3a-402a-a636-66b33ca48f29', 'c25c0ff9-64f8-467a-be35-f5bed964706c', '2026-05-01'::date, 'Hm. I said yes to something I wanted to say no to. Again. I miss my grandpa. He''d have had something funny to say about all this.', 'private', '2026-05-02T02:44:00+00:00'::timestamptz, '2026-05-02T02:44:24+00:00'::timestamptz),
  ('6d9075d8-92dd-42e9-8e4b-a3ad2b036b74', 'c25c0ff9-64f8-467a-be35-f5bed964706c', '2026-05-02'::date, 'This one''s hard. I think the answer is just: sleep more. It''s always sleep more. I cried in the car for no reason and then felt better. Bodies are weird. Spent way too long on my phone tonight. Not great.', 'private', '2026-05-03T01:29:00+00:00'::timestamptz, '2026-05-03T03:44:00+00:00'::timestamptz),
  ('bf223d33-13ec-4cda-a8b0-61ae45d08ee1', 'c25c0ff9-64f8-467a-be35-f5bed964706c', '2026-05-06'::date, 'Hm. I finally finished that book. The ending wrecked me. I''m trying to be gentler with myself and it feels fake but I''m doing it anyway. I cried in the car for no reason and then felt better. Bodies are weird. More tomorrow maybe.', 'private', '2026-05-07T02:52:00+00:00'::timestamptz, '2026-05-07T02:52:07+00:00'::timestamptz),
  ('0ae1b165-c47e-4e06-b9fa-b45c3531f280', 'c25c0ff9-64f8-467a-be35-f5bed964706c', '2026-05-11'::date, E'Lunch break entry.\n\nMy hands smell like garlic and I\'m happy. Ran into an old friend at the grocery store. We said we\'d get coffee. We won\'t. …', 'private', '2026-05-12T02:49:00+00:00'::timestamptz, '2026-05-12T02:49:39+00:00'::timestamptz),
  ('83cb1881-75f8-4037-b2f6-5d6d5a908f0f', 'c25c0ff9-64f8-467a-be35-f5bed964706c', '2026-05-12'::date, E'Writing this on the bus. I think the answer is just: sleep more. It\'s always sleep more. Made soup. Felt like a real adult for about forty minutes.\n\nI called my mom today and it was nice, we didn\'t fight about anything.', 'private', '2026-05-13T02:41:00+00:00'::timestamptz, '2026-05-13T02:41:36+00:00'::timestamptz),
  ('2ed83e96-2130-4119-8bf0-86604871317f', 'c25c0ff9-64f8-467a-be35-f5bed964706c', '2026-05-16'::date, E'In bed, can\'t sleep.\n\nI said yes to something I wantde to say no to. Again. The dog woke me up at 5 and honestly the sunrise was worth it. Got some good news today that I\'m not ready to share yet.\n\n…', 'private', '2026-05-17T02:46:00+00:00'::timestamptz, '2026-05-17T07:11:00+00:00'::timestamptz),
  ('c20ea6e0-4c89-43d5-8b1e-ce620ce6379b', 'c25c0ff9-64f8-467a-be35-f5bed964706c', '2026-05-18'::date, 'ugh. I tihnk I''ve been lonely and calling it independence. Breakup stuff is still weird. Some days fine, some days not. The light in the kitchen at 4pm is my favourite thing about this apartment. I signed up for a pottery class!! terrified!! I think I''m proud of how I handled the thing with my roommate. Anyway.', 'private', '2026-05-19T04:19:00+00:00'::timestamptz, '2026-05-19T04:19:15+00:00'::timestamptz),
  ('63df527a-d45d-4d6f-962b-816979d94431', 'c25c0ff9-64f8-467a-be35-f5bed964706c', '2026-05-23'::date, E'Easy one. what are you hungry for... let me think. I don\'t have a good answer to this one toda.y\n\nI said yes to something I wanted to say no to. Again.\n\nI ate lunch outside for the first time in weeks. 🙂', 'private', '2026-05-24T03:07:00+00:00'::timestamptz, '2026-05-24T03:07:27+00:00'::timestamptz),
  ('46cfd7f2-6efb-4c7d-a91d-a49bd047a21b', 'c25c0ff9-64f8-467a-be35-f5bed964706c', '2026-05-25'::date, E'Okay. The dog woke me up at 5 and honestly the sunrise was worth it.\n\nI read on the train instead of scrolling and felt like a different person.\n\nMore tomorrow maybe.', 'private', '2026-05-26T02:27:00+00:00'::timestamptz, '2026-05-26T02:27:30+00:00'::timestamptz),
  ('23efa907-95db-44fb-8de7-136a8c0e56c0', 'c25c0ff9-64f8-467a-be35-f5bed964706c', '2026-06-04'::date, E'Long day.\n\nSomething about rain makes everything feel allowed. I think I\'m proud of how I handled the thing with my roommate.\n\n…', 'private', '2026-06-05T03:22:00+00:00'::timestamptz, '2026-06-05T03:22:11+00:00'::timestamptz),
  ('23821fa7-2eb4-4688-9255-af5011a30ff8', 'c25c0ff9-64f8-467a-be35-f5bed964706c', '2026-06-05'::date, E'Lunch break entry. I called my mom today and it was nice, we didn\'t fight about anything.\n\nGoodnight.', 'private', '2026-06-06T02:26:00+00:00'::timestamptz, '2026-06-06T02:26:11+00:00'::timestamptz),
  ('9915e485-5d95-41db-bb80-78e4db54b926', 'c25c0ff9-64f8-467a-be35-f5bed964706c', '2026-06-10'::date, E'Late again lol. I cried in the car for no reason and then felt better. Bodies are weird.\n\nMy hands smell like garlic and I\'m happy. I read on the train instead of scrolling and felt like a different person.\n\nI keep starting things and not finishing them. Maybe that\'s fine? Maybe the starting is the point.\n\nGoodnight.', 'private', '2026-06-11T04:15:00+00:00'::timestamptz, '2026-06-11T04:15:26+00:00'::timestamptz),
  ('bff6dead-c761-4e99-8e5f-0efc1beac5f9', 'c25c0ff9-64f8-467a-be35-f5bed964706c', '2026-06-11'::date, 'Lunch break entry. Today I just did the next thing, and then the next thing. That was enough. I finally finished thta book. The ending wrecked me. I keep starting things and not finishing them. Maybe that''s fine? Maybe the starting is the point.', 'private', '2026-06-12T02:49:00+00:00'::timestamptz, '2026-06-12T02:49:21+00:00'::timestamptz),
  ('86d87e5d-6d40-4512-9732-0c82fcaf8289', 'c25c0ff9-64f8-467a-be35-f5bed964706c', '2026-06-17'::date, E'honestly\n\nThe light in the kitchen at 4pm is my favourite thing about this apartment. I keep replaying a dumb thing I said in a meeting. Nobody else remembers it, I\'m sure.\n\nToday I just did the next thing, and then the next thing. That was enough. we\'ll see.', 'private', '2026-06-18T02:13:00+00:00'::timestamptz, '2026-06-18T02:13:07+00:00'::timestamptz),
